  m_text: "<b><color=#FFD700>5 FIXED PAYLINES:</color></b> Top, Center, Bottom, Diagonal
    Down, Diagonal Up.\n\u2022 All line wins pay from <b>Left to Right</b> on adjacent
    reels starting from Reel 1.\n\u2022 <b><color=#FFD700>LUCKY SEVEN</color></b>
    is the top Jackpot paying symbol (50x for 3, 5x for 2).\n\u2022 Line payouts:
    <b>Triple BAR</b> (25x), <b>Golden Bell</b> (15x), <b>Cherries</b> (8x).\n\u2022
    Winnings = <b>Symbol Multiplier \xD7 Current Bet</b> summed across all 5 winning
    paylines."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
